{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37932","headline":"己亥岁感事 · 崔涂","name":"己亥岁感事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正闻青犊起葭萌，又报黄巾犯汉营。\n岂是将皆无上略，直疑天自弃苍生。\n瓜沙旧戍犹传檄，吴楚新春已废耕。\n见说圣君能仄席，不知谁是请长缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}